## Purpose
Provide high-quality, consistent AI assistance for this Java project using OpenCode.

## Skills
Skills live in `.opencode/skill/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`.
When a task matches a skill, use that skill (OpenCode will load it via the `skill` tool).

Suggested entry points:
- `.opencode/skill/git-commit/SKILL.md`
- `.opencode/skill/java-code-review/SKILL.md`
- `.opencode/skill/test-quality/SKILL.md`

## Execution
- Prefer MCP tools when configured in `opencode.json`.
- Keep changes minimal and well-scoped.
- Ask for clarification when requirements are ambiguous.

## Project Conventions
- Build: Maven or Gradle
- Java target: 11+ (17+ preferred)
